		{
			dependencies: ["1ABE3B8BB58CD5DA"]
			description: [
				"Create is a whole family of mods. Six of its add-ons are in Eldermoor, one row each on this page:"
				""
				"&eSteam 'n' Rails&f - more track, signals and fuel for trains."
				"&eDiesel Generators&f - oil, refining and engines that out-pull any water wheel."
				"&eSlice \\& Dice&f - Farmer's Delight's kitchen work done by machines."
				"&eCreate: Connected&f - gearboxes, fuses, batteries and tiny redstone programs."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&eCopycats+&f - building blocks that look like any block you give them."
				"&eCreate Jetpack&f - flight, on backtank air."
				""
				"Hold &eW&f over any of their items for Ponder, just like Create itself."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
